        {
          "text": "Jo ducu ma guneno guwacci, “Gin macalo man yam peya otimme, peya yam onen, cakke i kare ma yam jo Icrael gua ki i Ejipt, o wa onyoo; wutam, wupor lokke, ci wuloki.”",
